<!-- Core Differentiator: Why Partial-Guided? -->
<div class="container my-5 py-3">
  <div class="card border-0 rounded-4 p-4 p-lg-5 shadow-sm" style="background: #f1f6fc; border-left: 6px solid var(--primary-color) !important;">
    <div class="row align-items-center g-4">
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <span class="badge badge-partial-guided mb-2">The Tranoi Travel Standard</span>
        <h3 class="fw-bold text-primary mb-3">Why Travelers Choose Our Partial-Guided Format</h3>
        <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Traditional group tours rush you from monument to monument on rigid schedules. Independent planning leaves you stuck organizing airport transfers, booking tickets, and worrying about logistics.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-0">
          Our <strong>partial-guided</strong> format solves both: our certified local insiders guide you through intricate cultural treasures (like Hanoi street guilds and Hue imperial palaces), while generous unguided leisure windows let you explore cafes, beaches, and shops at your own pace. All logistics, domestic flights, and boutique stays are 100% arranged.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4 text-lg-end">
        <a href="/experiences/what-partial-guided-feels-like" class="btn btn-primary px-4 py-3 rounded-pill fw-bold">
          Learn How It Works &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Value Propositions Icon Row (4 Items Evenly Spaced) -->
  <div class="why-us-features-wrapper mt-5 pt-3">
    <div class="row g-4 align-items-center justify-content-between why-us-features-row">
